  <History Date="15-07-21" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed name from P12 Profile to P12 Profile HP.  Updated in line with v1.15, software &gt;= 1.1.0 (adds pink colour slot, gobo shake/scroll and control functions/macros.  calibrates blades)." Version="12" />
